  "notes": [
    "Lobby voice now plays to the whole crew without requiring a 3D camera. During a run, voices are directional and fade smoothly over 40 metres.",
    "Fixed a voice packet filter that discarded valid microphone frames arriving together. Playback buffers ordinary network bursts, levels quiet speech and limits simultaneous-speaker peaks.",
    "Voice settings include a live input meter and an explicit private 20-second microphone test. Select your device, enable the microphone, and use your bound push-to-talk key or open mic. F8 mutes.",
    "Active survivors\u2019 transmitted voices still draw hunters. Local microphone tests never transmit or attract hunters. Microphone input remains opt-in and pauses when the game loses focus.",
    "Update every player. Saved objective rotation, quieter player footsteps, dry Repeater steps, Reaver footfalls and station prop placement are preserved. No Suno downloads."
  ],
